#: templates/mfa/deactivate_totp.html:10
msgid "Remove two-factor authentication from your account"
msgstr "तपाईंको खाताबाट दुई-कारक प्रमाणीकरण हटाउनुहोस्"

#: templates/mfa/deactivate_totp.html:27
#: templates/mfa/totp/deactivate_form.html:37
msgid "Security Warning"
msgstr "सुरक्षा चेतावनी"

#: templates/mfa/deactivate_totp.html:30
#: templates/mfa/totp/deactivate_form.html:40
msgid ""
"Deactivating your authenticator app will reduce the security of your "
"account. You will only need your password to log in."
msgstr ""
"तपाईंको प्रमाणीकरण एप निष्क्रिय गर्दा तपाईंको खाताको सुरक्षा कम हुनेछ। "
"तपाईंलाई लग इन गर्न पासवर्ड मात्र आवश्यक हुनेछ।"

#: templates/mfa/deactivate_totp.html:39
#: templates/mfa/totp/deactivate_form.html:49
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to deactivate your authenticator app? This action will "
"remove two-factor authentication from your account."
msgstr ""
"के तपाईं आफ्नो प्रमाणीकरण एप निष्क्रिय गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ? यो कार्यले "
"तपाईंको खाताबाट दुई-कारक प्रमाणीकरण हटाउनेछ।"

#: templates/mfa/deactivate_totp.html:69
