msgstr "व्यक्तिगत संरचना स्कोरहरू कसरी मिलाइनेछ छान्नुहोस्"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:580
msgid ""
"Select which individual construct scales will be used in the computation"
msgstr "गणनामा कुन व्यक्तिगत संरचना स्केलहरू प्रयोग गरिनेछ छान्नुहोस्"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:583
msgid "Available Scoring Types:"
msgstr "उपलब्ध स्कोरिङ प्रकारहरू:"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:586
msgid "Sum"
msgstr "जोड"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:586
msgid "Adds all selected construct scores together"
msgstr "सबै छानिएका संरचना स्कोरहरू जोड्छ"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:587
msgid "Average"
msgstr "औसत"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:587
msgid "Calculates the mean of all selected construct scores"
msgstr "सबै छानिएका संरचना स्कोरहरूको औसत गणना गर्छ"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:588
msgid "Median"
msgstr "मध्यक"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:588
msgid "Finds the middle value of all selected construct scores"
msgstr "सबै छानिएका संरचना स्कोरहरूको मध्य मान फेला पार्छ"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:591
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "मोड"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:591
msgid "Identifies the most frequently occurring construct score"
msgstr "सबैभन्दा बढी देखा पर्ने संरचना स्कोर पहिचान गर्छ"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:592
msgid "Takes the lowest value among all selected construct scores"
msgstr "सबै छानिएका संरचना स्कोरहरू मध्ये सबैभन्दा कम मान लिन्छ"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:593
msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "अधिकतम"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:593
msgid "Takes the highest value among all selected construct scores"
msgstr "सबै छानिएका संरचना स्कोरहरू मध्ये सबैभन्दा उच्च मान लिन्छ"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:597
msgid "Common Use Cases:"
msgstr "सामान्य प्रयोग केसहरू:"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:599
msgid "Creating overall quality of life scores from multiple domains"
msgstr "धेरै डोमेनहरूबाट समग्र जीवनको गुणस्तर स्कोर सिर्जना गर्ने"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:600
msgid "Combining physical and emotional wellbeing measures"
msgstr "शारीरिक र भावनात्मक सुखस्वास्थ्य मापनहरू मिलाउने"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:601
msgid "Generating summary scores for clinical trial endpoints"
msgstr "क्लिनिकल ट्रायल एन्डपोइन्टहरूको लागि सारांश स्कोर उत्पन्न गर्ने"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:602
msgid "Creating simplified reporting metrics from complex questionnaires"
msgstr "जटिल प्रश्नावलीहरूबाट सरलीकृत प्रतिवेदन मेट्रिक्स सिर्जना गर्ने"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:607
#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_rules.html:55
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "नोट:"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:607
msgid ""
"Composite construct scores should only be created when there is theoretical "
"and statistical justification for combining the individual constructs. Refer "
"to the original questionnaire validation papers for guidance."
msgstr ""
"सम्मिश्रित संरचना स्कोरहरू व्यक्तिगत संरचनाहरू मिलाउनको लागि "
"सैद्धान्तिक र सांख्यिकीय औचित्य भएमा मात्र सिर्जना गर्नुपर्छ। "
"मार्गदर्शनको लागि मूल प्रश्नावली मान्यता पत्रहरू हेर्नुहोस्।"

#: templates/promapp/questionnaire_guidance.html:612
msgid "Create Composite Construct Score"
msgstr "सम्मिश्रित संरचना स्कोर सिर्जना गर्नुहोस्"

